From 20bf27b628b8cad043c9d933beb4bc3fec5e2988 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leonieziechmann <48921293+leonieziechmann@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:47:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] feat(data): crash-free decoder rules, item modifiers
 without tax, schemas, conformance fixtures

- decoder: base-quantity >= 0.0001 after rounding, 28 significant digits,
  amount range, nesting cap 8, VAT scope of modifiers, note/origin in
  bundles, null as array element, kind null/absent = item
- descriptor: item-modifier object (an item's modifier has its VAT category)
- committed invoice.schema.json and result.schema.json (typst eval)
- tests/data/conformance: fixtures (valid/invalid/lenient/decoder-only and
  default model dumps) and check-all.typ
- typstyle 0.15.1

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RaaQussN1QVEE8zRWeeCD3
